<p>Observe a virtual walking tour of the Santa Barbara Botanic Garden. Info=
rmation about the user's current Garden Section, as well as information abo=
ut nearby points of interest within 10 meters will display or be removed fr=
om the UI when the user enters or exits the buffer of each feature.</p>
